              <p>Michael has a remarkable gift for holding space. He has guided me through some of my toughest moments, helping me find my voice and feel comfortable in situations I once found overwhelming. Every process we've worked through has left me feeling clearer and more at peace.</p>
              <p>What strikes me most about him is his integrity. Whether one-on-one or in a group, his care is genuine and never for his own benefit. He is a pure soul who truly wants to see people thrive. I'm so grateful for his availability and his dedication to helping me improve my life.</p>
            </blockquote>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-parchment/45 italic">Jacob S. &middot; Has worked with Michael across adolescence and into adulthood</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Antony S. -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 sm:gap-10">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 shrink-0 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-parchment/10">
            <Image
              src={antonySPortrait}
