          <div>
            <blockquote class="font-heading text-lg md:text-xl text-parchment/75 italic leading-relaxed space-y-4 mb-4">
              <p>On meeting Michael for the first time, I was immediately drawn to his insightful, grounded approach. There is a depth to him that carries a sense of wisdom beyond his years.</p>
              <p>What stood out most for me was his ability to create a space where men can simply be as they are. A space where they can show up without pressure or expectation. The way he holds space comes from a place of genuine love and care.</p>
              <p>There is a natural quality in him that is rare, something that usually takes years to build in friendship, but was present from the moment we met.</p>
            </blockquote>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-parchment/45 italic">Antony S. &middot; Community elder, has known Michael through group and individual work</p>
